# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Desktop yt-dlp binaries — ~56 MB that the app never ships.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed, unlike the Android runtime and ffmpeg assets: those
# are packaged into the APK and must be present to build or test, whereas the
# desktop binaries are only a developer convenience. `BinaryManager` resolves a
# system install first and otherwise downloads the official build, so a fresh
# clone works without them. `tool/fetch_binaries.sh` puts them back if wanted.
#
# They are also not registered in `pubspec.yaml`'s `flutter.assets` — that has no
# per-platform scoping, so declaring them would pack ~56 MB into every APK.
/assets/bin/linux/
/assets/bin/macos/
/assets/bin/windows/
